    {
      "id": "product.claude-desktop",
      "slug": "claude-desktop",
      "name": "Claude Desktop",
      "title": "Claude Desktop (Anthropic)",
      "vendor": "Anthropic",
      "status": "proposal",
      "reviewed": "2026-11-22",
      "url": "https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/ec0078018250b2ceb6f114ac0085a38e0f969a7c/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/products/product.claude-desktop.md",
      "summaryHtml": "Claude Desktop brings &quot;Claude's capabilities directly to your computer&quot; (<a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/10065433-install-claude-desktop\">S1</a>). Anthropic makes it: a desktop app with Chat, Cowork, which &quot;brings Claude Code's agentic capabilities to knowledge work beyond coding&quot; (<a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/13345190-get-started-with-claude-cowork\">S3</a>), and a Code tab running Claude Code inside the app, so it is the <a href=\"https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/ec0078018250b2ceb6f114ac0085a38e0f969a7c/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/industry/industry.agent-host.md\">agent host</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/ec0078018250b2ceb6f114ac0085a38e0f969a7c/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/industry/industry.client.md\">client</a> of those sessions (<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/desktop\">S2</a>). It runs on macOS 13 or later, Windows 10 or later and, in beta, Linux (<a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/10065433-install-claude-desktop\">S1</a>). It is proprietary: Chat works on every plan, Claude Code and Cowork need a paid one (<a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/10065433-install-claude-desktop\">S1</a>). The latest release seen is v6.28899.6, of 20 November 2026, bundling Claude Code 2.1.330 (<a href=\"https://claude.com/docs/cowork/claude-desktop-changelog\">S7</a>).",
      "instanceOf": [
        {
          "id": "industry.agent-host",
          "label": "Agent host",
          "url": "https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/ec0078018250b2ceb6f114ac0085a38e0f969a7c/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/industry/industry.agent-host.md"
