    {
      "id": "product.cursor",
      "slug": "cursor",
      "name": "Cursor",
      "title": "Cursor (Anysphere)",
      "vendor": "Anysphere",
      "status": "proposal",
      "reviewed": "2026-11-22",
      "url": "https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/ec0078018250b2ceb6f114ac0085a38e0f969a7c/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/products/product.cursor.md",
      "summaryHtml": "Cursor lets developers build software with agents: &quot;Cursor is a coding agent for building ambitious software&quot;, &quot;the AI editor and coding agent&quot; (<a href=\"https://cursor.com/docs\">S1</a>). Anysphere, Inc. makes it, and on 14 August 2026 &quot;Cursor has officially been acquired by SpaceX&quot; (<a href=\"https://cursor.com/downloads\">S15</a>, <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/joining-spacex\">S17</a>). It runs as a desktop editor with an Agents Window, a terminal CLI, on the web, on iOS, in Slack, Linear and GitHub, and through an API (<a href=\"https://cursor.com/docs/cloud-agent\">S7</a>, <a href=\"https://cursor.com/docs/agent/agents-window\">S9</a>, <a href=\"https://cursor.com/downloads\">S15</a>). It is sold by subscription, from a free tier to Enterprise; no open-source licence was seen (<a href=\"https://cursor.com/pricing\">S16</a>). The latest desktop release seen is 3.31, undated (<a href=\"https://cursor.com/downloads\">S15</a>), and the latest CLI v2026.11.17 (<a href=\"https://cursor.com/docs/cli/changelog\">S14</a>). It is an <a href=\"https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/ec0078018250b2ceb6f114ac0085a38e0f969a7c/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/industry/industry.agent-harness.md\">agent harness</a> and a <a href=\"https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/ec0078018250b2ceb6f114ac0085a38e0f969a7c/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/industry/industry.client.md\">client</a>. Its skills follow the <a href=\"https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/ec0078018250b2ceb6f114ac0085a38e0f969a7c/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/specs/agent-skills/spec.agent-skills.md\">Agent Skills specification</a>.",
      "instanceOf": [
        {
          "id": "industry.agent-harness",
