              "id": "S10",
              "titleHtml": "Orca CLI 1.4.269 help, read on sol: <code>orca --help</code>, <code>skills list</code>, <code>agent launch --help</code>, <code>orchestration send --help</code>, <code>claude-teams --help</code>, no URL",
              "read": "2026-11-22"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "industry.session",
          "slug": "session",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "&quot;Working chats resume automatically after an Orca restart&quot;; resume from Session History in a new chat or CLI",
